-- title:
--   Original Lévy moving signed predictable unit coefficients preserve adaptive negative Taylor L2 vanishing
-- statement:
--   Original source Lévy stopped C2 Taylor square-energy tails vanish with arbitrary moving predictable real coefficients of absolute value at most one and decreasing jointly predictable marked cutoffs. The proof bounds coefficient squares by one using |a_n|≤1 and applies the accepted unweighted adaptive L2 tail theorem to the unchanged original predictable measure times X.ν on negative marks.
-- source:
--   W7-07 original-source signed unit predictable contraction L2 energy strengthening.

